# Repository line-ending convention: text files are stored with LF in the index.
# Working-tree endings follow each user's core.autocrlf, so Windows checkouts stay CRLF.
# This keeps any later edit from committing mixed CRLF/LF (VF-11b review finding 2).
* text=auto

# Never let auto-detection touch binary assets.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.wav binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.pyd binary
